[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905002753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116307#issuecomment-3905002753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116307","id":3905002753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7owZ0B","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T18:57:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T18:57:22Z","body":"@BlueCube3310 If you have time, can you take a look?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905002753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910197819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116307#issuecomment-3910197819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116307","id":3910197819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pEOI7","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T19:20:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T19:20:15Z","body":"I've looked around at other DDS loaders, and it looks like R8 and RG8 are both nonstandard formats. For instance, GIMP and Paint.net (DirectXTex) read an R8 file as L8, but both will fail when given an RG8 file. On the other hand, NVIDIA Texture Tools can properly read both files. \r\nSince when it comes to compatibility between loaders/writers the DDS file format is already a huge mess, I think this should be fine to add to the engine.\r\nI'm not certain about the `_UINT` DXGI formats though, since their purpose is to specifically map to integer-based `Image` formats (i.e. `DXGI_FORMAT_R16_UINT` to `FORMAT_R16I`), rather than the 'standard' UNORM formats.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910197819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3918012158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116307#issuecomment-3918012158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116307","id":3918012158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7piB7-","user":{"login":"Quantx","id":2834674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzQ2NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2834674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx","html_url":"https://github.com/Quantx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T01:40:02Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T02:11:12Z","body":"The `_UINT` was actually a mistake on my part. You're correct that they should be `_UNORM` but this raises a few conflicts with the existing importer.\r\n\r\nWe should probably make `R8_UNORM` map to `FORMAT_R8` and `A8_UNORM` map to `FORMAT_L8` instead of them both mapping to `FORMAT_L8`:\r\n```c\r\ncase DXGI_R8_UNORM:\r\ncase DXGI_A8_UNORM: {\r\n\treturn DDS_LUMINANCE;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt also looks like `R8G8_UNORM` is already mapped to `FORMAT_LA8` and there aren't any good `DXGI` alternatives for it. I'd argue that mapping `R8G8_UNORM` to `FORMAT_RG8` makes more sense and is probably the expected behavior, but I don't want to remove support for `FORMAT_LA8`.\r\n```c\r\ncase DXGI_R8G8_UNORM: {\r\n\treturn DDS_LUMINANCE_ALPHA;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf you have any suggestions for how to accommodate both `FORMAT_RG8` and `FORMAT_LA8` let me know. Maybe `R8G8_TYPELESS`?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3918012158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919888301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116307#issuecomment-3919888301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116307","id":3919888301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ppL-t","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T10:08:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T10:08:55Z","body":"I think it's fine to map the DXGI R8/R8G8 to `FORMAT_R8`/`FORMAT_RG8`, most writers make use of the 'legacy' dds header for simple uncompressed formats anyway, so compatibility wouldn't be broken.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919888301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3920000683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116307#issuecomment-3920000683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116307","id":3920000683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ppnar","user":{"login":"Quantx","id":2834674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzQ2NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2834674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx","html_url":"https://github.com/Quantx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T10:29:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T10:29:43Z","body":"I've mapped `DXGI_R8_UNORM` / `DXGI_R8G8_UNORM` to `FORMAT_R8` / `FORMAT_RG8` and dropped `DXGI` support for `FORMAT_LA8`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3920000683/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923750329","html_url":"https://github.com/go